# Rooftop Assassin: "Flash. Flying, lifelink. When this creature enters, destroy target creature an opponent controls that was dealt
# damage this turn." On turn 2, at Bot2's end step, Bot1 shocks Bot2's Wall of Wood (it survives with 2 damage) and flashes in the
# Assassin (CR 702.8a) with Black Lotus and a Mox: its trigger can choose the damaged Wall but not Bot2's undamaged Grizzly Bears
# (CR 115.1, 120.2), so the Wall alone is destroyed (CR 701.8a) and the Bears are untouched. The Assassin has the keywords its text gives.

